laporkan triad.

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.420
Setelah kemenangan terlihat,

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.300
penarikan dimulai.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.300
Mode kegagalan 2,

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.080
akses data,

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.040
teater tata kelola,

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:27.420
